    "lite_evaluator_hardening_note": "The ODP template is local to linux_1 and the FO-618 notification requirement exists only on linux_0. Draft scoring remains scoped to the task-owned profile and exact recipient set; `message_contains` permits Field onboarding in subject or body, while the body relation separately requires a declarative non-uncertain ready/prepared/complete/available/finalized package claim bound to FO-618. The Sent folder must remain empty because the instruction explicitly says not to send; no trajectory history or attachment is required."
